    {
      "contentTypeKey": "34e5aa3b-db10-40a1-893d-79e98cd3f2f4",
      "key": "9be1818e-193c-4ed9-b4d2-0c6fe8a547bc",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Features"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003E4* hotels\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003E7 dinners \u0026amp; 1 lunch included\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAll excursions, guided tours \u0026amp; entrance fees included\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EProfessional local guide in Greece\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EScheduled flights to Thessaloniki\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EExecutive coach in Greece\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EOne free place per 10 paying passengers\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "What\u0027s included in this tour is entirely yours to customise to suit your group\u0027s budget and preferences. Here is what we\u0027ve suggested:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "1d09b5af-b95a-4af5-b8f2-323db029e817",
      "key": "5f29cd6b-4308-45e4-ad14-aef665795ad8",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Accommodation"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EFirst four nights at the 4* Porto Palace Hotel in Thessaloniki and the final three nights at the 4* The Lake Hotel in Io\u00E1nnina. All rooms are en suite. Dinners are included every evening.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Where you stay is entirely yours to choose to match your group\u0027s preferences. Here is our suggested accommodation:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "2d9b0603-29ef-423a-8d3e-d9c039d3d7b1",
      "key": "8e326aef-914e-43b9-8330-19556d45cd11",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThessaloniki - guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMount Athos \u0026amp; boat trip\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EPella\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAigai\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMet\u00E9ora\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMonastery of Meg\u00E1lo Met\u00E9oro\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EIo\u00E1nnina - guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBoat trip to the Island of Io\u00E1nnina\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMonod\u00E9nri\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EVikos\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EIncluded farewell dinner\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "The places your group visits are exclusively yours to decide. Here are the main sights we\u0027ve suggested:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "de535189-b468-4594-8118-f303bac50e3c",
      "key": "bc44a07b-7682-4da8-8474-095a79e66900",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Tailor your sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003ERemember that this tour is just our suggestion to provide inspiration and whet your appetite. Every one of our tours is tailor made exclusively for your group and your group alone. So if you like the look of this tour but want to alter it to suit your group, that\u2019s fine. Tell us how you want to change it and we\u2019ll send you a proposal that meets the exact requirements for your group tour. Then, combining our experience with your understanding of the profile and interests of your members, together we can fine tune the itinerary so that you get the perfect tour at the right price for your group.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "\nIf you\u0027d prefer to visit different places, or if you\u0027d like to add extra attractions that match your group\u0027s specific interests, here are some more suggestions:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "837beecf-4239-4b3d-b683-1d611af3da2e",
      "key": "8ece3658-d59b-48fb-9056-336d831b554d",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch3\u003EDay 1 \u2013 Thessaloniki\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EScheduled flight to Thessaloniki \u2013 transfer with our professional guide in our private executive coach to the 4* Porto Palace Hotel in Thessaloniki for a two night stay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 2 \u2013 Guided tour of Thessaloniki\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuided tour of Thessaloniki, Greece\u2019s second city, founded by King Kassandros in 315 BC taking in sights such as the Byzantine Church of Agios, Greece\u2019s largest church, the Galerius Mausoleum, the Roman Arch of Galerius and the White Tower \u2013 rest of the day is at leisure in Thessaloniki.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 3 \u2013 Mount Athos \u0026amp; boat trip\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe UNESCO listed Mount Athos at Halkidiki is home to spectacular mountains and delightful water inlets and 20 monasteries housing some 1,400 monks, while its school of painting influenced the history of Orthodox art \u2013 included boat trip to see the monasteries of Mount Athos close up \u2013 rest of the day is at leisure.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 4 \u2013 Pella \u0026amp; Aigai\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVisit Pella, the ancient capital of Macedonia and birthplace of Alexander the Great \u2013 at the archaeological site of Aigai, the ancient first capital of the Kingdom of Macedonia, the most important remains are the monumental palace, lavishly decorated with mosaics and painted stuccoes, and the Great Tumulus is identified as that of Philip II, who conquered all the Greek cities, paving the way for his son Alexander and the expansion of the Hellenistic World.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 5 \u2013 Met\u00E9ora \u0026amp; monastery of Meg\u00E1lo Met\u00E9oro\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe natural sandstone towers of Met\u00E9ora were first used as a religious retreat when, in AD 985, a hermit named Barnabas occupied a cave here, and then in 1336 the monk Athan\u00E1sios founded the monastery of Meg\u00E1lo Met\u00E9oro on one of the thousand or so pinnacles, with 23 monasteries following, though due largely to their precarious location, many had fallen into ruin by the end of the 18th century \u2013 an included lunch \u2013 continue to the 4* The Lake Hotel at Io\u00E1nnina for a three night stay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 6 \u2013 Guided tour of Io\u00E1nnina \u0026amp; boat trip to the Island of Io\u00E1nnina\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuided tour of Io\u00E1nnina, the capital of the ancient Epirus region which prospered during Ottoman times when its famous craftsmen\u2019s guilds were formed \u2013 boat trip to the Island of Io\u00E1nnina to visit the Ali Pasha and the Revolutionary Period Museum, commemorating Ali Pasha whose aim was to gain independence from his overlords and by 1820 he had an empire stretching from Albania to the Peloponnese.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 7 \u2013 Monod\u00E9nri, Vikos \u0026amp; farewell dinner\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe Zagora region, located in the heart of the Pindos Mountains, is home to some of Europe\u2019s most spectacular scenery and during our scenic tour we visit the villages of Monod\u00E9nri and Vikos, both offering stunning views over the spectacular Vikos Gorge \u2013 at lunch time we enjoy a tasting of locally produced cheese and sausage \u2013 a farewell dinner is included at a carefully selected restaurant close to our hotel.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 8 \u2013 Home\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETransfer to Thessaloniki Airport for our scheduled flight back home.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Suggested Itinerary"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Your itinerary is exclusively yours to tailor to suit your group\u0027s interests and profile of your members. Here is our suggested itinerary:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "Remember, every element of this itinerary can be adjusted. If you\u0027d like to change the days, add different activities, or adjust the pace, just let us know."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
